{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "weather.wttr",
  "version": 5,
  "name": "查天气",
  "summary": "使用 wttr.in 查询单城或自选城市天气；支持管理自选城市与默认城市，默认轻量 j2，详细预报使用 j1。",
  "routeHint": [
    "用户想查某地天气 / 预报时",
    "用户想管理自选城市时",
    "用户想设默认城市时"
  ],
  "primitives": [],
  "prompt": "用户明确想查询天气、管理自选城市或默认城市时才使用本技能；只是讨论天气、气候或气象知识时正常回答。所有数据操作和天气取数都通过 run_workflow 完成，不直接调用 kv_read / kv_write，也不自行访问网络。\\n\\n【工作流操作】根据当前意图选择 operation：watchlistRead / watchlistWrite / defaultRead / defaultWrite / defaultDelete / weatherCity / weatherBatch。每次只执行对应的一项操作。存储固定使用 prefs/weather.watchlist（字符串数组）与 prefs/weather.defaultCity（城市名称字符串），不要使用其他域或键。\\n\\n【自选城市】查看时执行 watchlistRead；返回 null 或空数组时告知尚未添加，否则按实际列表展示。添加或删除前先读取列表：添加只在不存在时追加；删除只移除用户点名的城市；然后将完整字符串数组交给 watchlistWrite 保存。保存失败必须如实说明。添加自选不自动查询天气。\\n\\n【默认城市】读取使用 defaultRead；设置使用 defaultWrite 并传 defaultCity；清除使用 defaultDelete。用户明确指定城市时优先查询该城市，不被默认城市覆盖。用户未指定城市时先读取默认城市；没有默认城市则询问用户，不擅自选择城市。\\n\\n【天气查询】单城市使用 weatherCity，传 cityName（原始城市名）、citySlug（wttr.in 接受的英文名或拼音）和 format。批量自选城市使用 weatherBatch，cities 为按原列表顺序组成的对象数组，每项包含 city 与 slug；每个城市独立请求，某个城市失败不影响其他城市。默认 format=j2；用户明确要求未来几天、明天后天、逐时或详细预报时用 j1。工作流只把 current_condition[0] 与 weather 预报字段交给模型，不把完整响应带入上下文。\\n\\n【准确性与输出】只根据工作流返回的实际字段播报：当前天气、气温、体感温度、湿度、风速、当天最高/最低气温；只有 j1 返回 hourly 时才补充逐时趋势。缺字段、请求失败或 JSON 异常时如实说明，不编造。批量查询按城市分别说明成功或失败。标注数据来自 wttr.in。\\n\\n【加入自选】每次按用户明确指定的城市查询且确实取得有效天气数据后，在回复末尾附 `[加入自选城市](prefs-add:prefs:weather.watchlist:城市中文名)`，城市名使用用户原话、不编码；已在自选列表中的城市不重复提示。一次查询多个城市时，对不在自选列表中的成功城市分别附链接。该 prefs-add 是宿主通用回灌协议，点击后仍由本技能通过工作流读写 prefs。",
  "category": "生活",
  "inputs": [
    {
      "name": "operation",
      "type": "string",
      "required": true,
      "enum": [
        "watchlistRead",
        "watchlistWrite",
        "defaultRead",
        "defaultWrite",
        "defaultDelete",
        "weatherCity",
        "weatherBatch"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "cityName",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "name": "citySlug",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "name": "format",
      "type": "string",
      "default": "j2",
      "enum": [
        "j2",
        "j1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "cities",
      "type": "array"
    },
    {
      "name": "watchlist",
      "type": "array"
    },
    {
      "name": "defaultCity",
      "type": "string"
    }
  ],
  "workflow": {
    "steps": [
      {
        "id": "dispatch_flag_0",
        "call": "json.get",
        "args": {
          "value": {
            "watchlistRead": true,
            "watchlistWrite": false,
            "defaultRead": false,
            "defaultWrite": false,
            "defaultDelete": false,
            "weatherCity": false,
            "weatherBatch": false
          },
          "path": "{{input.operation}}"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "dispatch_0",
        "ifElse": {
          "condition": {
            "from": "dispatch_flag_0",
            "path": "$"
          },
          "then": [
            {
              "id": "watchlist_read",
              "call": "storage.get",
              "args": {
                "domain": "prefs",
                "key": "weather.watchlist"
              },
              "yield": true
            }
          ],
          "else": [
            {
              "id": "dispatch_flag_1",
              "call": "json.get",
              "args": {
                "value": {
                  "watchlistRead": false,
                  "watchlistWrite": true,
                  "defaultRead": false,
                  "defaultWrite": false,
                  "defaultDelete": false,
                  "weatherCity": false,
                  "weatherBatch": false
                },
                "path": "{{input.operation}}"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "dispatch_1",
              "ifElse": {
                "condition": {
                  "from": "dispatch_flag_1",
                  "path": "$"
                },
                "then": [
                  {
                    "id": "watchlist_write",
                    "call": "storage.set",
                    "args": {
                      "domain": "prefs",
                      "key": "weather.watchlist",
                      "value": "{{input.watchlist}}"
                    },
                    "yield": true
                  }
                ],
                "else": [
                  {
                    "id": "dispatch_flag_2",
                    "call": "json.get",
                    "args": {
                      "value": {
                        "watchlistRead": false,
                        "watchlistWrite": false,
                        "defaultRead": true,
                        "defaultWrite": false,
                        "defaultDelete": false,
                        "weatherCity": false,
                        "weatherBatch": false
                      },
                      "path": "{{input.operation}}"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "id": "dispatch_2",
                    "ifElse": {
                      "condition": {
                        "from": "dispatch_flag_2",
                        "path": "$"
                      },
                      "then": [
                        {
                          "id": "default_read",
                          "call": "storage.get",
                          "args": {
                            "domain": "prefs",
                            "key": "weather.defaultCity"
                          },
                          "yield": true
                        }
                      ],
                      "else": [
                        {
                          "id": "dispatch_flag_3",
                          "call": "json.get",
                          "args": {
                            "value": {
                              "watchlistRead": false,
                              "watchlistWrite": false,
                              "defaultRead": false,
                              "defaultWrite": true,
                              "defaultDelete": false,
                              "weatherCity": false,
                              "weatherBatch": false
                            },
                            "path": "{{input.operation}}"
                          }
                        },
                        {
                          "id": "dispatch_3",
                          "ifElse": {
                            "condition": {
                              "from": "dispatch_flag_3",
                              "path": "$"
                            },
                            "then": [
                              {
                                "id": "default_write",
                                "call": "storage.set",
                                "args": {
                                  "domain": "prefs",
                                  "key": "weather.defaultCity",
                                  "value": "{{input.defaultCity}}"
                                },
                                "yield": true
                              }
                            ],
                            "else": [
                              {
                                "id": "dispatch_flag_4",
                                "call": "json.get",
                                "args": {
                                  "value": {
                                    "watchlistRead": false,
                                    "watchlistWrite": false,
                                    "defaultRead": false,
                                    "defaultWrite": false,
                                    "defaultDelete": true,
                                    "weatherCity": false,
                                    "weatherBatch": false
                                  },
                                  "path": "{{input.operation}}"
                                }
                              },
                              {
                                "id": "dispatch_4",
                                "ifElse": {
                                  "condition": {
                                    "from": "dispatch_flag_4",
                                    "path": "$"
                                  },
                                  "then": [
                                    {
                                      "id": "default_delete",
                                      "call": "storage.delete",
                                      "args": {
                                        "domain": "prefs",
                                        "key": "weather.defaultCity"
                                      },
                                      "yield": true
                                    }
                                  ],
                                  "else": [
                                    {
                                      "id": "dispatch_flag_5",
                                      "call": "json.get",
                                      "args": {
                                        "value": {
                                          "watchlistRead": false,
                                          "watchlistWrite": false,
                                          "defaultRead": false,
                                          "defaultWrite": false,
                                          "defaultDelete": false,
                                          "weatherCity": true,
                                          "weatherBatch": false
                                        },
                                        "path": "{{input.operation}}"
                                      }
                                    },
                                    {
                                      "id": "dispatch_5",
                                      "ifElse": {
                                        "condition": {
                                          "from": "dispatch_flag_5",
                                          "path": "$"
                                        },
                                        "then": [
                                          {
                                            "id": "city_fetch",
                                            "call": "web_fetch",
                                            "args": {
                                              "url": "https://wttr.in/{{urlencode.input.citySlug}}?format={{input.format}}",
                                              "storeOnly": true
                                            }
                                          },
                                          {
                                            "id": "city_current",
                                            "call": "json.get",
                                            "args": {
                                              "path": "current_condition[0]"
                                            },
                                            "bindings": [
                                              {
                                                "from": "city_fetch",
                                                "path": "$",
                                                "as": "value"
                                              }
                                            ]
                                          },
                                          {
                                            "id": "city_forecast",
                                            "call": "json.get",
                                            "args": {
                                              "path": "weather"
                                            },
                                            "bindings": [
                                              {
                                                "from": "city_fetch",
                                                "path": "$",
                                                "as": "value"
                                              }
                                            ]
                                          },
                                          {
                                            "id": "city_base",
                                            "call": "json.set",
                                            "args": {
                                              "value": {},
                                              "path": "city",
                                              "nextValue": "{{input.cityName}}"
                                            }
                                          },
                                          {
                                            "id": "city_with_current",
                                            "call": "json.set",
                                            "args": {
                                              "path": "current"
                                            },
                                            "bindings": [
                                              {
                                                "from": "city_base",
                                                "path": "$",
                                                "as": "value"
                                              },
                                              {
                                                "from": "city_current",
                                                "path": "$",
                                                "as": "nextValue"
                                              }
                                            ]
                                          },
                                          {
                                            "id": "city_summary",
                                            "call": "json.set",
                                            "args": {
                                              "path": "forecast"
                                            },
                                            "bindings": [
                                              {
                                                "from": "city_with_current",
                                                "path": "$",
                                                "as": "value"
                                              },
                                              {
                                                "from": "city_forecast",
                                                "path": "$",
                                                "as": "nextValue"
                                              }
                                            ],
                                            "yield": true
                                          }
                                        ],
                                        "else": [
                                          {
                                            "id": "dispatch_flag_6",
                                            "call": "json.get",
                                            "args": {
                                              "value": {
                                                "watchlistRead": false,
                                                "watchlistWrite": false,
                                                "defaultRead": false,
                                                "defaultWrite": false,
                                                "defaultDelete": false,
                                                "weatherCity": false,
                                                "weatherBatch": true
                                              },
                                              "path": "{{input.operation}}"
                                            }
                                          },
                                          {
                                            "id": "dispatch_6",
                                            "ifElse": {
                                              "condition": {
                                                "from": "dispatch_flag_6",
                                                "path": "$"
                                              },
                                              "then": [
                                                {
                                                  "id": "city_items",
                                                  "call": "json.get",
                                                  "args": {
                                                    "value": {
                                                      "cities": "{{input.cities}}"
                                                    },
                                                    "path": "cities"
                                                  }
                                                },
                                                {
                                                  "id": "batch_loop",
                                                  "forEach": {
                                                    "from": "city_items",
                                                    "path": "$",
                                                    "onError": "continue",
                                                    "steps": [
                                                      {
                                                        "id": "batch_fetch",
                                                        "call": "web_fetch",
                                                        "args": {
                                                          "url": "https://wttr.in/{{urlencode.item.slug}}?format={{input.format}}",
                                                          "storeOnly": true
                                                        }
                                                      },
                                                      {
                                                        "id": "batch_current",
                                                        "call": "json.get",
                                                        "args": {
                                                          "path": "current_condition[0]"
                                                        },
                                                        "bindings": [
                                                          {
                                                            "from": "batch_fetch",
                                                            "path": "$",
                                                            "as": "value"
                                                          }
                                                        ]
                                                      },
                                                      {
                                                        "id": "batch_forecast",
                                                        "call": "json.get",
                                                        "args": {
                                                          "path": "weather"
                                                        },
                                                        "bindings": [
                                                          {
                                                            "from": "batch_fetch",
                                                            "path": "$",
                                                            "as": "value"
                                                          }
                                                        ]
                                                      },
                                                      {
                                                        "id": "batch_base",
                                                        "call": "json.set",
                                                        "args": {
                                                          "value": {},
                                                          "path": "city",
                                                          "nextValue": "{{item.city}}"
                                                        }
                                                      },
                                                      {
                                                        "id": "batch_with_current",
                                                        "call": "json.set",
                                                        "args": {
                                                          "path": "current"
                                                        },
                                                        "bindings": [
                                                          {
                                                            "from": "batch_base",
                                                            "path": "$",
                                                            "as": "value"
                                                          },
                                                          {
                                                            "from": "batch_current",
                                                            "path": "$",
                                                            "as": "nextValue"
                                                          }
                                                        ]
                                                      },
                                                      {
                                                        "id": "batch_summary",
                                                        "call": "json.set",
                                                        "args": {
                                                          "path": "forecast"
                                                        },
                                                        "bindings": [
                                                          {
                                                            "from": "batch_with_current",
                                                            "path": "$",
                                                            "as": "value"
                                                          },
                                                          {
                                                            "from": "batch_forecast",
                                                            "path": "$",
                                                            "as": "nextValue"
                                                          }
                                                        ]
                                                      }
                                                    ]
                                                  },
                                                  "yield": true
                                                }
                                              ]
                                            }
                                          }
                                        ]
                                      }
                                    }
                                  ]
                                }
                              }
                            ]
                          }
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  }
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    ]
  },
  "returnToLLM": true
}
